      "ID": 4,
      "TextContent": "We are currently {\r\nlocation = GetSpriteTextureName(\"background\") \r\n\r\nif location == \"fenner\" then\r\n\tdamage = math.random(5, 10)\r\n\tTakeDamage(damage )\r\n\treturn \"in fenner, which means you take \" .. damage .. \" damage\"\r\n\r\nelseif location == \"larkin\" then\r\n\treturn \"in larkin, so you take no damage\"\r\n\r\nelseif location == \"middleton\" then\r\n\thealth= math.random(5, 10)\r\n\tRestoreHealth(health)\r\n\treturn \"in middleton hall, so you are now healed\"\r\nend\r\n}",
      "Attributes": [
